    "name": "The Last Viking",
    "steam_appid": 3142500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/932b402edd529f99341405477e62ecdf.avif?t=1728674357\" width=616 height=130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/0087efd7f161b64baf36a24774c7bc9d.avif?t=1728674357\" width=616 height=130 /></span><br>The Last Viking is an immersive <strong>first-person</strong> multiplayer <strong>cooperative survival</strong> game. You play as a young Viking warrior on a journey of survival, exploration, and discovery. Stranded on a secluded island filled with secrets and dangers, you must harness your skills to survive against the odds. Engage in epic battles, craft powerful tools, and uncover ancient mysteries as you strive to <strong>fulfill your destiny</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploring the world and survive</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/20c371af00d4319320dfb596f82d14cc.poster.avif?t=1728674357\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/20c371af00d4319320dfb596f82d14cc.webm?t=1728674357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Step into a <strong>beautifully crafted world</strong> where survival is your primary goal. The island you explore is teeming with life and shrouded in mystery. Manage your <strong>hunger</strong>, <strong>thirst</strong>, <strong>sleep</strong>, and stay vigilant against the changing weather. Every corner of the <strong>island </strong>hides secrets that will aid you in your <strong>quest</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fighting Enemies</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/794048eb4f14e7cebc76d589a06758f9.poster.avif?t=1728674357\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/794048eb4f14e7cebc76d589a06758f9.webm?t=1728674357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Battle </strong>ferocious beasts, skeletons, and mythical creatures in intense combat. Master your <strong>weapons </strong>and hone your combat skills to take on the island's deadliest foes. Engage in thrilling <strong>boss fights</strong> against legendary creatures, each offering unique challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and craft</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/6e25de9a2e19e11cf5c5671ed37772e6.poster.avif?t=1728674357\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/6e25de9a2e19e11cf5c5671ed37772e6.webm?t=1728674357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Forge your path to survival by <strong>crafting</strong> essential tools and <strong>constructing </strong>vital shelters. <strong>Gather resources</strong> from the environment and discover recipes that will help you craft everything from simple weapons to powerful Viking gear. <strong>Build structures</strong> to protect yourself from the elements and upgrade your arsenal to stand a better chance against the dangers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with your friend</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/ff84404e3977d9585f12a73e9af424e5.poster.avif?t=1728674357\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3142500/extras/ff84404e3977d9585f12a73e9af424e5.webm?t=1728674357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Experience The Last Viking in <strong>cooperative multiplayer</strong> mode, where up to 8 players can team up to survive and conquer the island <strong>together</strong>. Share resources, strategize in combat, and build a Viking settlement with your friends.",
